Pick Up Notifier for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Pick Up Notifier (26.3.0) by Fuzs.
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/pickupnotifier
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the pickup tracking, HUD layout, and configuration are
implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

LICENSE is the original project's MPL-2.0 licence. None of the original project's
All-Rights-Reserved image assets are included: the experience orb HUD graphics are
procedurally generated original work for this port.
